Values below 1e-99: three-digit exponents in a meshtal file
c One 14 MeV neutron ray along +x through void (as mctal/probe.mcnp);
c FM1004 scales the flux by 1e-110, so MCNP prints values like
c 2.50000-113, without the E. Regenerate with:
c mcnp6 i=tiny_values.mcnp n=tiny_values.
1 0  -99 imp:n=1
2 0  99 imp:n=0

99 SO 200

MODE N
SDEF POS=-100 0.3 0.7 VEC=1 0 0 DIR=1 ERG=14 TME=0
NPS 10
PRDMP 2j 1
FMESH1004:N ORIGIN -40 -10 -10 IMESH 40 IINTS 4 JMESH 10 JINTS 1 KMESH 10 KINTS 1
FM1004 1e-110
FMESH1014:N ORIGIN -40 -10 -10 IMESH 40 IINTS 4 JMESH 10 JINTS 1 KMESH 10 KINTS 1
     OUT=IJ
FM1014 1e-110
